      "value": "With minor differences, this is a duplicate feature request, and can be merged with:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/returning-audio-sources-to-quest-devices-and-how-id-imagine-it\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-audio\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-avatar-audio\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-audio-pls\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-audio-sources-on-quest-avatars\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatar-audio-on-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/audio-source-for-oculus-quest-1\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/bring-back-avatar-audio-for-the-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/we-want-audio-back-on-quest\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatar-sounds-1\n\n- (possibly many more other requests)\n\nPer [Android Content Limitations](https://creators.vrchat.com/platforms/android/quest-content-limitations/): \"Audio sources are disabled completely for avatars on Android and Quest. Audio sources consume a significant amount of CPU resources and voices have priority.\"",
